<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Launch Radar — Pre-token protocols by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="brand">
    <h1>Token Launch Radar</h1>
    <p class="sub">Pre-token protocols ranked by implied value — which one is worth farming next, and what to do about it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="meta" id="meta"></div>
</header>

<section class="stats" id="stats"></section>

<section class="controls">
  <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search name or slug" aria-label="Search">
  <select id="cat" aria-label="Category"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
  <label class="watch"><input id="watch" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only</label>
  <span class="count" id="count"></span>
</section>

<main>
  <section id="detail" class="detail" hidden></section>
  <table id="board">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="num">#</th>
        <th>Protocol</th>
        <th>Category</th>
        <th>Chains</th>
        <th class="num">TVL</th>
        <th class="num">1d</th>
        <th class="num">7d</th>
        <th class="num">30d</th>
        <th class="num">Implied value</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
  </table>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>Implied value = max(TVL, $50M) × category multiple × momentum × chain diversity. Pre-token means no token recorded, and no wrapped, staked or bridged product of one that trades. Data: DefiLlama protocol snapshot.</p>
</footer>

<script src="../data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
